<html>
 <head>
  <title></title>
 </head>
 <body style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; height: auto; min-height: auto;">
  <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; max-width:600px; margin:0 0 16px 0;">
   <img alt="mi-email-header" src="https://movingintelligence.file.force.com/file-asset-public/miemailheader?oid=00D1t000000uTfK" style="max-width:600px; width:100%; height:auto; display:block; border:0;" title="mi-email-header" width="600" />
  </div>
  <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; padding: 10px; font-size:14px; color:#1A1A1A;">
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;">Dear {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;">We were unable to collect your payment. This can happen, for example, when there are insufficient funds in the account at the time of collection.</p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px 0;">No action is needed: we will automatically try to collect the payment again on {{{Payment__c.Retry_Date__c}}}. Please make sure the amount is available on that date.</p>
   <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #E0E0E0;margin:24px 0;" />
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;margin:0 0 8px 0;"><strong style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Payment reference:</strong> {{{Payment__c.Name}}}</p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;margin:0 0 8px 0;"><strong style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Amount:</strong> {{{Payment__c.Amount_Gross__c}}}</p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;margin:0 0 24px 0;">If the payment has been made in the meantime, please disregard this message.</p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px 0;">Kind regards,
    <br />
    <strong style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">{{{Payment__c.Sender_Name__c}}}</strong></p>
   <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; margin:24px 0 0 0;">
    <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; margin-bottom:10px;">
     <img alt="mi-logo-black" src="https://movingintelligence.file.force.com/file-asset-public/milogoblack?oid=00D1t000000uTfK" style="width: 180px" title="mi-logo-black" />
    </div>
    <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; width:20px; border-top:2px solid #FF0000; font-size:0; line-height:0; margin-bottom:10px;">&#xa0;</div>
    <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-weight:400; font-size:14px; line-height:20px; color:#5B625B;">
     <strong style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">knowledge in motion<span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#FF0000;">.</span></strong>
     <br />
     <a href="https://movingintelligence.co.uk" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#5B625B">movingintelligence.co.uk</a>
    </div>
   </div>
   <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #E0E0E0;margin:24px 0;" />
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#777777;margin:0 0 8px 0;"><strong style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Do not share this email</strong>
    <br />
    This email contains a personal, secure link and is addressed specifically to you. Do not share this email or the link with anyone else.</p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#777777;margin:0 0 8px 0;"><strong style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Questions about this document?</strong>
    <br />
    If you have any questions about the details or contents of the document, please contact us directly by email: {{{Payment__c.Sender_Email__c}}}</p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#777777;margin:0 0 8px 0;">This message was sent by {{{Payment__c.Sender_Name__c}}}. We believe in communicating with our customers carefully and respectfully, and we don't want to burden you with unnecessary information. <a href="{{{Recipient.Preference_Center_Url__c}}}" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#777777;">You can manage your preferences here</a>.</p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#777777;margin:0 0 8px 0;">Did you not request this message yourself? Please feel free to contact the sender of this request directly, and we will be happy to sort this out for you.</p>
  </div>
 </body>
</html>